{"seq":2,"slug":"async-networking","title":"Nim 异步与网络编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/ecosystem/async-networking","wordCount":709,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"nim-异步与网络编程\">Nim 异步与网络编程</h1><p>Nim 的异步编程模型基于单线程事件循环 + 协程变换：<code>async</code> 过程被编译器转为状态机，<code>await</code> 在 Future 未就绪时让出控制权给事件循环。这种模式可以在单线程内驱动数万并发连接，是构建高性能网络服务的基础。标准库提供 <code>asyncdispatch</code> 模块，社区的 Chronos 库则是另一个广泛使用的替代方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>async/await</strong>：编译器将 async proc 转为闭包迭代器（状态机），await 是暂停/恢复边界</li>\n<li><strong>Future[T]</strong>：表示异步操作结果的容器，状态为 Pending/Finished/Failed</li>\n<li><strong>事件循环</strong>：单线程 poll 模型，基于 epoll（Linux）/ kqueue（macOS）/ IOCP（Windows）</li>\n<li><strong>asyncCheck</strong>：启动不阻塞的并发协程（fire-and-forget，异常被传播到事件循环）</li>\n<li><strong>Chronos</strong>：Status/Nimbus 团队的高性能替代方案，支持 Future 取消和多事件循环实例</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"async-await-基础模型\">async/await 基础模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/[asyncdispatch, asyncnet]&#10;&#10;proc handleClient(client: AsyncSocket) {.async.} =&#10;  while true:&#10;    let line = await client.recvLine()&#10;    if line.len == 0:&#10;      break&#10;    await client.send(&quot;Echo: &quot; &amp; line &amp; &quot;\\n&quot;)&#10;  client.close()&#10;&#10;proc serve() {.async.} =&#10;  let server = newAsyncSocket()&#10;  server.setSockOpt(OptReuseAddr, true)&#10;  server.bindAddr(Port(8080))&#10;  server.listen()&#10;  echo &quot;Server listening on port 8080&quot;&#10;&#10;  while true:&#10;    let client = await server.accept()&#10;    asyncCheck handleClient(client)  # 不阻塞，启动新协程&#10;&#10;waitFor serve()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/[asyncdispatch, asyncnet]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc handleClient(client: AsyncSocket) {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let line = await client.recvLine()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if line.len == 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await client.send(\"Echo: \" &#x26; line &#x26; \"\\n\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  client.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc serve() {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let server = newAsyncSocket()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server.setSockOpt(OptReuseAddr, true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server.bindAddr(Port(8080))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server.listen()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"Server listening on port 8080\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let client = await server.accept()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    asyncCheck handleClient(client)  # 不阻塞，启动新协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>waitFor serve()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器将 <code>async</code> 过程变换为闭包迭代器（状态机），每个 <code>await</code> 点是一个暂停/恢复边界：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[async proc 调用] --&gt; B[创建 Future 对象]&#10;    B --&gt; C[执行到第一个 await]&#10;    C --&gt; D{底层 I/O 就绪?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[注册到事件循环 + 让出]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[继续执行]&#10;    E --&gt; G[事件循环 poll 其他 Future]&#10;    G --&gt; D&#10;    F --&gt; H{还有更多 await?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| C&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[完成 Future / 设置 result]\">graph TD\n    A[async proc 调用] --&gt; B[创建 Future 对象]\n    B --&gt; C[执行到第一个 await]\n    C --&gt; D{底层 I/O 就绪?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[注册到事件循环 + 让出]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[继续执行]\n    E --&gt; G[事件循环 poll 其他 Future]\n    G --&gt; D\n    F --&gt; H{还有更多 await?}\n    H --&gt;|是| C\n    H --&gt;|否| I[完成 Future / 设置 result]</pre><h2 id=\"future-t-与错误处理\">Future[T] 与错误处理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/asyncdispatch&#10;&#10;proc riskyOperation(): Future[string] {.async.} =&#10;  await sleepAsync(100)&#10;  if rand(10) &lt; 3:&#10;    raise newException(IOError, &quot;random failure&quot;)&#10;  return &quot;success&quot;&#10;&#10;proc robustCaller() {.async.} =&#10;  # 方式 1：try/except&#10;  try:&#10;    let result = await riskyOperation()&#10;    echo &quot;Got: &quot;, result&#10;  except IOError as e:&#10;    echo &quot;Failed: &quot;, e.msg&#10;&#10;  # 方式 2：检查 Future 状态&#10;  let fut = riskyOperation()&#10;  await fut  # 等待完成&#10;  if fut.failed:&#10;    echo &quot;Error: &quot;, fut.error.msg&#10;  else:&#10;    echo &quot;Value: &quot;, fut.read\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/asyncdispatch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc riskyOperation(): Future[string] {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await sleepAsync(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if rand(10) &#x3C; 3:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    raise newException(IOError, \"random failure\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return \"success\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc robustCaller() {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 方式 1：try/except</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = await riskyOperation()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"Got: \", result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  except IOError as e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"Failed: \", e.msg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 方式 2：检查 Future 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let fut = riskyOperation()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await fut  # 等待完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if fut.failed:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"Error: \", fut.error.msg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"Value: \", fut.read</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Future 状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>检查方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pending</td>\n<td>尚未完成</td>\n<td><code>not fut.finished</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finished</td>\n<td>成功完成</td>\n<td><code>fut.finished and not fut.failed</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Failed</td>\n<td>异常终止</td>\n<td><code>fut.failed</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"http-服务器与客户端\">HTTP 服务器与客户端</h2><h3 id=\"标准库-asynchttpserver\">标准库 asynchttpserver</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/[asynchttpserver, asyncdispatch, json]&#10;&#10;proc handler(req: Request) {.async.} =&#10;  case req.reqMethod&#10;  of HttpGet:&#10;    if req.url.path == &quot;/health&quot;:&#10;      await req.respond(Http200, &quot;OK&quot;, newHttpHeaders())&#10;    elif req.url.path == &quot;/api/data&quot;:&#10;      let data = %*{&quot;status&quot;: &quot;ok&quot;, &quot;count&quot;: 42}&#10;      await req.respond(Http200, $data,&#10;        newHttpHeaders([(&quot;Content-Type&quot;, &quot;application/json&quot;)]))&#10;    else:&#10;      await req.respond(Http404, &quot;Not Found&quot;)&#10;  of HttpPost:&#10;    let body = parseJson(req.body)&#10;    echo &quot;Received: &quot;, body&#10;    await req.respond(Http201, &quot;&quot;&quot;{&quot;created&quot;: true}&quot;&quot;&quot;)&#10;  else:&#10;    await req.respond(Http405, &quot;Method Not Allowed&quot;)&#10;&#10;let server = newAsyncHttpServer()&#10;echo &quot;HTTP server on :3000&quot;&#10;waitFor server.serve(Port(3000), handler)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/[asynchttpserver, asyncdispatch, json]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc handler(req: Request) {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  case req.reqMethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  of HttpGet:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if req.url.path == \"/health\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await req.respond(Http200, \"OK\", newHttpHeaders())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    elif req.url.path == \"/api/data\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      let data = %*{\"status\": \"ok\", \"count\": 42}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await req.respond(Http200, $data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        newHttpHeaders([(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await req.respond(Http404, \"Not Found\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  of HttpPost:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let body = parseJson(req.body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"Received: \", body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await req.respond(Http201, \"\"\"{\"created\": true}\"\"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await req.respond(Http405, \"Method Not Allowed\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let server = newAsyncHttpServer()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo \"HTTP server on :3000\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>waitFor server.serve(Port(3000), handler)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"http-客户端\">HTTP 客户端</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/[asyncdispatch, httpclient, json]&#10;&#10;proc fetchData(url: string): Future[JsonNode] {.async.} =&#10;  let client = newAsyncHttpClient()&#10;  defer: client.close()&#10;&#10;  let response = await client.get(url)&#10;  if response.code != Http200:&#10;    raise newException(IOError, &quot;HTTP &quot; &amp; $response.code)&#10;&#10;  let body = await response.body&#10;  return parseJson(body)&#10;&#10;proc main() {.async.} =&#10;  let data = await fetchData(&quot;https://api.example.com/users&quot;)&#10;  for item in data:&#10;    echo item[&quot;name&quot;].getStr()&#10;&#10;waitFor main()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/[asyncdispatch, httpclient, json]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc fetchData(url: string): Future[JsonNode] {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let client = newAsyncHttpClient()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  defer: client.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let response = await client.get(url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if response.code != Http200:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    raise newException(IOError, \"HTTP \" &#x26; $response.code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let body = await response.body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return parseJson(body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc main() {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let data = await fetchData(\"https://api.example.com/users\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for item in data:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo item[\"name\"].getStr()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>waitFor main()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发模式-多-future-组合\">并发模式：多 Future 组合</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/asyncdispatch&#10;&#10;proc fetchAll(urls: seq[string]): Future[seq[string]] {.async.} =&#10;  ## 并发发起所有请求，等待全部完成&#10;  var futures: seq[Future[string]]&#10;  let client = newAsyncHttpClient()&#10;&#10;  for url in urls:&#10;    futures.add(client.getContent(url))&#10;&#10;  result = newSeq[string](urls.len)&#10;  for i, fut in futures:&#10;    result[i] = await fut&#10;&#10;  client.close()&#10;&#10;# 带超时的等待&#10;proc withTimeout[T](fut: Future[T], ms: int): Future[T] {.async.} =&#10;  let timeoutFut = sleepAsync(ms)&#10;  await fut or timeoutFut&#10;  if fut.finished:&#10;    return fut.read&#10;  else:&#10;    raise newException(IOError, &quot;timeout after &quot; &amp; $ms &amp; &quot;ms&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/asyncdispatch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc fetchAll(urls: seq[string]): Future[seq[string]] {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 并发发起所有请求，等待全部完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var futures: seq[Future[string]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let client = newAsyncHttpClient()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for url in urls:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    futures.add(client.getContent(url))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = newSeq[string](urls.len)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for i, fut in futures:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result[i] = await fut</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  client.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 带超时的等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc withTimeout[T](fut: Future[T], ms: int): Future[T] {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let timeoutFut = sleepAsync(ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await fut or timeoutFut</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if fut.finished:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return fut.read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    raise newException(IOError, \"timeout after \" &#x26; $ms &#x26; \"ms\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"chronos-高性能替代方案\">Chronos：高性能替代方案</h2><p>Chronos 是 Status/Nimbus 团队开发的异步框架，针对高吞吐和低延迟场景优化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import chronos&#10;&#10;proc handleConnection(transp: StreamTransport) {.async.} =&#10;  var buf = newSeq[byte](4096)&#10;  while true:&#10;    let bytesRead = await transp.readOnce(addr buf[0], buf.len)&#10;    if bytesRead == 0: break&#10;    await transp.write(addr buf[0], bytesRead)&#10;  await transp.closeWait()&#10;&#10;proc startServer() {.async.} =&#10;  let server = createStreamServer(&#10;    initTAddress(&quot;0.0.0.0:9000&quot;),&#10;    handleConnection,&#10;    flags = {ReuseAddr}&#10;  )&#10;  server.start()&#10;  echo &quot;Chronos server on :9000&quot;&#10;  await server.join()&#10;&#10;waitFor startServer()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import chronos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc handleConnection(transp: StreamTransport) {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var buf = newSeq[byte](4096)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let bytesRead = await transp.readOnce(addr buf[0], buf.len)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if bytesRead == 0: break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await transp.write(addr buf[0], bytesRead)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await transp.closeWait()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc startServer() {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let server = createStreamServer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    initTAddress(\"0.0.0.0:9000\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    handleConnection,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    flags = {ReuseAddr}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  server.start()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"Chronos server on :9000\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await server.join()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>waitFor startServer()</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>asyncdispatch</th>\n<th>Chronos</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>标准库</td>\n<td>社区（Status）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件循环</td>\n<td>单一全局</td>\n<td>可多实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消支持</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>原生 Future 取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>raise + try</td>\n<td>CatchableError + Result</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高（Nimbus 验证）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用</td>\n<td>一般应用</td>\n<td>高性能/区块链</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"websocket-通信\">WebSocket 通信</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/[asyncdispatch, asynchttpserver]&#10;import ws  # nimble install ws&#10;&#10;proc wsHandler(req: Request) {.async.} =&#10;  var ws = await newWebSocket(req)&#10;&#10;  while ws.readyState == Open:&#10;    let msg = await ws.receiveStrPacket()&#10;    echo &quot;Received: &quot;, msg&#10;    await ws.send(&quot;Server got: &quot; &amp; msg)&#10;&#10;  echo &quot;Client disconnected&quot;&#10;&#10;let server = newAsyncHttpServer()&#10;waitFor server.serve(Port(8080), wsHandler)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/[asyncdispatch, asynchttpserver]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import ws  # nimble install ws</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc wsHandler(req: Request) {.async.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var ws = await newWebSocket(req)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  while ws.readyState == Open:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let msg = await ws.receiveStrPacket()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"Received: \", msg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await ws.send(\"Server got: \" &#x26; msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"Client disconnected\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let server = newAsyncHttpServer()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>waitFor server.serve(Port(8080), wsHandler)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"异步与-orc-内存管理的关系\">异步与 ORC 内存管理的关系</h2><p>关键事实：标准 <code>asyncdispatch</code> 的 Future 实现<strong>会产生循环引用</strong>（Future 持有回调闭包，闭包捕获包含 Future 的变量）。因此：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>async</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">--mm:arc</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>内存泄漏</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{async} + \\texttt{--mm:arc} = \\text{内存泄漏}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">async</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">--mm:arc</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存泄漏</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>使用 <code>async</code> 时必须搭配 <code>--mm:orc</code>（默认）以确保循环被正确回收。如果明确需要 ARC 的确定性（如嵌入式场景），则需使用 Chronos 或手动管理 Future 生命周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Nim 的异步编程在简洁性和性能之间取得了良好平衡：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>async/await 语法与 Python/JavaScript 几乎相同，但底层是零分配的状态机变换</li>\n<li>单线程事件循环模型避免了多线程的锁竞争，适合 I/O 密集型高并发场景</li>\n<li>asyncdispatch 适合一般应用，Chronos 经过 Nimbus 区块链客户端的高吞吐验证</li>\n<li>Future 组合子（并发等待、超时包装）使复杂异步编排保持声明式风格</li>\n<li>关键注意：async + ORC 是必须组合——ARC 无法回收 Future 产生的循环引用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于 Nim 在实际项目中的应用谱系——从网络服务到区块链到 CLI 工具，参见 <a href=\"nim-use-cases\">Nim 应用场景</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nim 异步与网络编程","id":"nim-异步与网络编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"async/await 基础模型","id":"async-await-基础模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Future[T] 与错误处理","id":"future-t-与错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 服务器与客户端","id":"http-服务器与客户端"},{"level":3,"text":"标准库 asynchttpserver","id":"标准库-asynchttpserver"},{"level":3,"text":"HTTP 客户端","id":"http-客户端"},{"level":2,"text":"并发模式：多 Future 组合","id":"并发模式-多-future-组合"},{"level":2,"text":"Chronos：高性能替代方案","id":"chronos-高性能替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"WebSocket 通信","id":"websocket-通信"},{"level":2,"text":"异步与 ORC 内存管理的关系","id":"异步与-orc-内存管理的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nimble 包管理器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/ecosystem/nimble-package-manager"},"next":{"title":"Nim 应用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/ecosystem/nim-use-cases"}}